            </note>
            <note corresp="#d512-f2" n="2" xml:id="d512-f2-content">
                <p>Ludwig W. Rajchman, Polish director, Health Section, League of Nations.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d512-f3" n="3" xml:id="d512-f3-content">
                <p>League of Nations, <hi rendition="#italic">Appeal by the Chinese Government,
